Branch: REL_10_STABLE [f5157a9ac] 2022-08-24 13:01:40 -0400
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [e07ebd4b6] 2022-08-13 15:21:28 -0400
