     <para>
      修复与 LLVM 15 的不兼容问题（Thomas Munro，Andres Freund）
</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [1c72d82c2] 2022-11-02 17:37:29 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [a5737e765] 2022-11-02 17:37:26 -0400
