Branch: REL_10_STABLE [b53442f6f] 2022-05-12 11:31:46 -0400
-->
     <para>
      修复在提升引用了 <literal>GROUPING</literal> 函数的子 <literal>SELECT</literal> 时出现的
      <quote>variable not found in subplan target list</quote> 规划器错误
      （Richard Guo）
</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Alvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
Branch: master [ec0925c22] 2022-08-05 09:47:26 +0200
