Branch: REL_11_STABLE [fed35bd4a] 2021-07-16 13:01:43 -0400
-->
     <para>将分区表的触发器克隆到新分区时，确保复制其启用状态（&Aacute;lvaro Herrera）</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
