     <para>构建或重建索引时，容许因并发更新而出现新的 HOT 链（Anastasia Lubennikova，&Aacute;lvaro Herrera）</para>

     <para>这一疏漏可能导致 <quote>failed to find parent tuple for heap-only tuple</quote> 错误。</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
