Branch: REL9_6_STABLE [3cdf2421a] 2020-04-16 14:45:54 -0400
Branch: REL9_5_STABLE [46b1b6379] 2020-04-16 14:45:54 -0400
-->
     <para>修复 <filename>contrib/sepgsql</filename> 中的缓存引用泄漏（Michael Luo）</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [8c49454ca] 2020-03-30 11:14:58 -0400
Branch: REL_12_STABLE [de5b9db36] 2020-03-30 11:14:58 -0400
Branch: REL_11_STABLE [4bc3a1667] 2020-03-30 11:14:58 -0400
Branch: REL_10_STABLE [d59e83cf5] 2020-03-30 11:14:58 -0400
Branch: REL9_6_STABLE [f15f5edee] 2020-03-30 11:14:58 -0400
Branch: REL9_5_STABLE [6dac1e858] 2020-03-30 11:14:58 -0400
-->
     <para>避免在 Windows 上处理 Unix 风格区域设置名称时发生失败（Juan Jos&eacute; Santamar&iacute;a Flecha）</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [0bc8cebdb] 2020-03-17 12:09:26 -0400
Branch: REL_12_STABLE [d8e7f8149] 2020-03-17 12:09:26 -0400
Branch: REL_11_STABLE [9af2f7dc9] 2020-03-17 12:09:27 -0400
Branch: REL_10_STABLE [d67d7243f] 2020-03-17 12:09:27 -0400
-->
     <para>在 <application>configure</application> 期间，如果 <application>pkg-config</application> 可用，则使用它定位 <application>libxml2</application>（Hugh McMaster，Tom Lane，Peter Eisentraut）</para>

     <para>如果 <application>pkg-config</application> 不存在，或不包含 <application>libxml2</application> 的信息，我们仍像以前一样查询 <application>xml2-config</application>。</para>

     <para>某些构建过程通过将非默认版本的 <application>xml2-config</application> 放入 <varname>PATH</varname>，来让 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 使用该版本的 <application>libxml2</application>；此项修改可能使这些构建过程失效。应改为设置 <varname>XML2_CONFIG</varname>，使其指向非默认的 <application>xml2-config</application>。这种方法对较旧和较新的 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 发行版都适用。</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [beb2516e9] 2020-05-06 21:08:15 +0900
Branch: REL_12_STABLE [8c0939dad] 2020-05-06 21:08:22 +0900
