Branch: REL9_4_STABLE [ba1dfbe22] 2020-01-20 23:32:21 -0800
-->
     <para>修复使用按引用传递的聚合转换状态时发生的罕见崩溃（Andres Freund，Teodor Sigaev）</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
