     <para>在顶层调用非 GNU make 时，允许将 <application>make</application> 选项向下传递给 <application>gmake</application>（Thomas Munro）</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [3754113f3] 2019-07-26 12:45:32 -0400
Branch: REL_12_STABLE [e31dfe99c] 2019-07-26 12:45:52 -0400
