Branch: REL9_4_STABLE [69f32206d] 2019-06-10 23:37:02 -0700
-->
     <para>避免在未连接到特定数据库的进程中，为检查参数而尝试访问数据库（Vignesh C，Andres Freund）</para>

     <para>此错误可能导致 <quote>cannot read pg_class without having selected a database</quote> 等失败。</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [ddf927fb1] 2019-05-13 10:53:19 -0400
Branch: REL_11_STABLE [6b0e9411f] 2019-05-13 10:53:19 -0400
