Branch: REL9_4_STABLE [42b204db2] 2019-02-03 17:49:04 +0900
-->
     <para>在 <application>pgxs</application> 构建中支持新的 Makefile 变量 <literal>PG_CFLAGS</literal>、<literal>PG_CXXFLAGS</literal> 和 <literal>PG_LDFLAGS</literal>（Christoph Berg）</para>

     <para>这简化了扩展构建过程的自定义。</para>
    </listitem>

